<PageTitle>JBIDS | Job Based Instructional Design System</PageTitle>
<HeadContent><meta name="description" content="Build instruction grounded in employer needs. JBIDS connects job announcements to training objectives, supporting evidence, and human review." /></HeadContent>
<section class="hero">
    <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">From employer needs to meaningful learning</p>
        <h1>Build instruction.<br /><span>Back it with evidence.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">JBIDS — Job Based Instructional Design System — helps educators turn real job requirements into clear, reviewed training objectives. Keep the evidence connected as your curriculum takes shape.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/projects">Open projects <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#how-it-works">See how it works <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
        <p class="hero-note">Open source. Educator led. Human reviewed.</p>
    </div>
    <aside class="evidence-preview" aria-label="Example of an objective connected to employer evidence">
        <div class="preview-heading"><span class="status-dot"></span> A clear line from evidence to instruction</div>
        <div class="preview-source"><span class="preview-label">01 / JOB ANNOUNCEMENT</span><h2>Embedded software developer</h2><p>“Develop and test firmware for embedded systems.”</p></div>
        <div class="connection-line" aria-hidden="true"><span>↓</span> Supporting evidence preserved</div>
        <div class="preview-objective"><span class="preview-label">02 / TRAINING OBJECTIVE</span><h2>Implement and test firmware for an embedded system.</h2><div class="preview-tags"><span>Bloom’s level: Apply</span><span>Ready for review</span></div></div>
        <p class="preview-caption">Illustrative example · Your review makes the decision.</p>
